pricing plugin

This plugin comes from the `pricing` plugin, version 1.10.1, in a private
repository of ai-advanced-futures (plugins/pricing/). Luis F. Amadeo wrote it.
It is under the MIT license. This plugin ports it, with changes.

The pricing framework behind the plugin is the JustKeenAI Agentic Pricing
Framework v2.1. ATTRIBUTION.md names it.

